    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Over 200 teams of young athletes from 26 universities based in Karachi, Hyderabad and Bahawalpur came together to take part in the 3rd AKU Inter-University Sports Olympiad which was organised by the student-led AKU Sports Society.",
